    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "M. A teacher may be retained at his existing step on the salary schedule if identifiable unsatisfactory performance exists. The following procedure shall be used:",
            "block_bbox": [
                49,
                96,
                502,
                151
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 0,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    49.0,
                    96.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    96.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    151.0
                ],
                [
                    49.0,
                    151.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The principal shall notify the teacher in writing of the specific areas where unsatisfactory performance is alleged, including specific examples. Notification shall occur prior to the beginning of the second semester.",
            "block_bbox": [
                73,
                150,
                503,
                221
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    73.0,
                    150.0
                ],
                [
                    503.0,
                    150.0
                ],
                [
                    503.0,
                    221.0
                ],
                [
                    73.0,
                    221.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. A conference shall be held between the principal and the teacher within ten (10) duty days to review the alleged unsatisfactory performance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                70,
                222,
                502,
                275
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    70.0,
                    222.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    222.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    275.0
                ],
                [
                    70.0,
                    275.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. A specific remediation plan, including reasonable timelines, shall then be developed by the principal. Assistance shall be given to the teacher. It is understood that this process applies only to deficiencies which if uncorrected could be job threatening.",
            "block_bbox": [
                71,
                275,
                502,
                346
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    71.0,
                    275.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    275.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    346.0
                ],
                [
                    71.0,
                    346.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Within ten (10) duty days of the development of the specific remediation plan, the teacher may request an independent review of the remediation plan and its causes by the appropriate Associate Superintendent or designee.",
            "block_bbox": [
                71,
                346,
                502,
                417
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    71.0,
                    346.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    346.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    417.0
                ],
                [
                    71.0,
                    417.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Failure to perform satisfactorily prior to May 1 may result in a recommendation for retention on the salary schedule by the principal, with concurrence of the Associate Superintendent. The Deputy Superintendent for Instruction or his designee other than a previous reviewer, shall then review all pertinent documentation and make a recommendation to the Superintendent. A copy shall be provided to the Association.",
            "block_bbox": [
                72,
                418,
                503,
                542
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    72.0,
                    418.0
                ],
                [
                    503.0,
                    418.0
                ],
                [
                    503.0,
                    542.0
                ],
                [
                    72.0,
                    542.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. The Superintendent shall make a decision for retention on the salary schedule prior to June 1 and shall notify the teacher with a copy sent to the Association.",
            "block_bbox": [
                72,
                542,
                503,
                595
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    72.0,
